            "review_title": "Review at Pasteur Street Craft Beer Bùi Viện - Premium Local Craft Beer in HCMC",
            "review_text": "Kaitlyn C\nCanberra, Australia33 contributions\n0\nIncredible vibes and great food and beer.\nJan 2026 • Family\nOur family had such a fun night here! The atmosphere here is second to none. If you can get a table on the street, highly recommend! The Bui Vien waling street is across the road and the vibes are electric. The food was incredible, the beer delicious, and the service was amazing. The menu had so many options. My daughter had her best fried rice here. And the tacos were also delicious.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 18, 2026",
