            "review_title": "Review at Pasteur Street Craft Beer Bùi Viện - Premium Local Craft Beer in HCMC",
            "review_text": "Peter-Chua\nSingapore, Singapore1935 contributions\n0\nGreat beer\nJan 2026 • Friends\nPasteur Street Brewing Company on Bui Vien is the undisputed premier spot for local craft beer in HCMC. Its location, diagonally across from the walking street, offers a prime balcony for incredible people-watching, providing a front-row seat to the area's vibrant energy while you enjoy their exceptional brews. Inside is an oasis for beer lovers, serving award-winning, creative beers that expertly blend craft tradition with bold Vietnamese ingredients. The perfect place to savor Saigon's craft revolution and its street life in one go.\nRead more\nWritten January 12, 2026",
